WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.688
This example creates stay days in the CTE Each CTE

00:00:05.714 --> 00:00:11.438
row represents one completed admission The final
query joins patients

00:00:11.465 --> 00:00:17.272
and calculates admission count and average stay per
patient The grain changes

00:00:17.299 --> 00:00:22.851
only in the final GROUP BY That separation makes the
transformation

00:00:22.877 --> 00:00:24.075
easier to validate
